        "headline": "Cursor, Windsurf, or GitHub Copilot -- reach the tier your subscription doesn't include.",
        "body": "Your native subscription already includes multi-vendor frontier-lab access (Claude, GPT, Gemini) -- that part isn't Undercut's value-add. What Undercut adds: evidence-based escalation logic on top of whatever's already available, plus reaching openweights tiers (DeepSeek, GLM, and similar) that native subscriptions don't include at all.",
        "openrouter_framing": "Unlocks a tier you don't have. Add an OpenRouter key in your tool's own BYOK settings specifically to reach the cheap openweights tier -- this is presented as unlocking access your subscription doesn't include, not as a generic 'add a key' instruction. Additive on top of what you already have; your existing multi-vendor access through the tool's own subscription is untouched.",
        "honesty_caveat": "The multi-vendor frontier-lab access you already have is not something Undercut is adding -- we're only claiming the part that's genuinely new: the openweights tier and the routing logic on top of it.",
